# world-feed-db — local key placeholders (clean profile).
# Copy this file to `.env` beside it (profiles/clean/.env), fill in the keys you
# have, done. Never commit the filled file — `profiles/*/.env` is gitignored.
# Keys are optional: every key-gated source shows an honest
# UNAVAILABLE · KEY REQUIRED state until its key is present.
# Check status any time:   py -3.11 -m wfd keys
#
# Signup lanes + notes: ACCOUNTS-AND-KEYS.md (repo root).
